WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:08.240
the power of god is manifested in the beating&nbsp;
of the heart in the action of the lungs and in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:12.800
the living currents that circulate through&nbsp;
the thousand different channels of the body&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:19.680
we are indebted to him for every moment of&nbsp;
existence and for all the comforts of life&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:27.040
the powers and abilities that elevate man&nbsp;
above the lower creation are the endowment&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:33.760
of the creator he loads us with his benefits&nbsp;
we are indebted to him for the food we eat&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:40.960
the water we drink the clothes we wear the air&nbsp;
we breathe without his special providence the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:47.520
air will be filled with pestilence and poison&nbsp;
he is a bountiful benefactor and preserver&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:56.160
the sun which shines upon the earth and glorifies&nbsp;
all nature the weird solemn radiance of the moon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.960 --> 00:01:03.280
the glories of the firmament spangled with&nbsp;
brilliant stars the showers that refresh the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:10.720
land and cause vegetation to flourish the&nbsp;
precious things of nature in all the very&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:19.360
richness the lofty trees the shrubs and plants&nbsp;
the waving grain the blue sky the green earth the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:28.000
changes of day and night the renewing seasons all&nbsp;
speak to man of his creator's love he has linked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:35.280
us to himself by all these tokens in heaven and&nbsp;
in earth he watches over us with more tenderness&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:41.520
than does a mother over an afflicted child&nbsp;
like as a father pitieth his children&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.320 --> 00:01:53.840
so the lord pity of them that fear him counsels&nbsp;
on stewardship page 17 paragraphs 1 to 4.

00:01:58.960 --> 00:01:59.460
you

